to re-enter the game.

41
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,320
(Case 4)
I knew after finishing Case 4,

42
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:33,880
Designer Bai would target my friends.

43
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:37,120
So I had to think of a way quickly.

44
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,320
After everyone went to rest,

45
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,920
