834
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:32,280
Crazy Animal Theme Party.

835
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,400
We returned to the game lobby.

836
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:36,240
I told everyone

837
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:37,520
