875
00:24:40,200 --> 00:24:42,920
We arrived at 777 Happiness Road.

876
00:24:43,440 --> 00:24:44,880
Room 1111.

877
00:24:45,560 --> 00:24:47,080
During the investigation,

878
00:24:47,080 --> 00:24:49,080
we suspected they were

